{"id":598450,"shortDescription":"Slice Dice &amp; Rice es un juego indie de lucha sin barras de energía. Inspirado en La Espada de Bushido, gira en torno a la idea de encontrar un punto débil en la defensa del oponente y terminar el turno con un único golpe limpio. Sin los tediosos puntos por golpe – cada arañazo limita tu movimiento, cada herida podría ser la última.","developers":["Dojo Games"],"publishers":["Ultimate Games S.A."],"categories":["Un jugador","Multijugador","JcJ","JcJ a pantalla (com)partida","Pantalla partida/compartida","Compat. parcial con mando","Remote Play Together","Préstamo familiar"],"releaseDateRaw":"27 ABR 2017","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/598450?t=1792157565","screenshots":[{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/598450/ss_0859a7771c235f08ed50e81ef7ca9fa157f0b8e8.600x338.jpg?t=1792157565","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/598450/ss_0859a7771c235f08ed50e81ef7ca9fa157f0b8e8.1920x1080.jpg?t=1792157565"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/598450/ss_3c78907172d1192729574389cab5f361ddd7f9e9.600x338.jpg?t=1792157565","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/598450/ss_3c78907172d1192729574389cab5f361ddd7f9e9.1920x1080.jpg?t=1792157565"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/598450/ss_dd2ce94179f8c2e1f81bce645e18c37c3adcb793.600x338.jpg?t=1792157565","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/598450/ss_dd2ce94179f8c2e1f81bce645e18c37c3adcb793.1920x1080.jpg?t=1792157565"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/598450/ss_91bc32555f80f6bb510339af9ff8db7fd94f6c31.600x338.jpg?t=1792157565","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/598450/ss_91bc32555f80f6bb510339af9ff8db7fd94f6c31.1920x1080.jpg?t=1792157565"